# English-only route paths

App **URLs / pathnames** must use English segments. UI copy may be localized
in locale catalogs (ADR 0013). All other engineering output is English
(`language-and-locales.mdc`) — a Spanish prompt does not change pathnames.

## Do

- Routes, `href`, `Link`, `redirect`, `pathname` checks, and nav config: English only
  (`/login`, `/cases`, `/contractors`, `/settings`, …)

## Do not

- Non-English path segments
- Mixing locale into the primary route tree until aliases are explicitly requested
